      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787676665788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class loader system - it will load the classes\n \nwhich ever classes will be loaded so that its object will be created in HEAP area \n\n1. bootstrap loader - all the fundamental classes for java whichever are use for our program\n\nYour Program\n     ↓\nneeds String\n     ↓\nBootstrap Class Loader\n     ↓\nloads fundamental Java classes\n\n\n2. extenison class loader -those classes which help in runtime enviroment will be loaded by\nexteinion class loader.\n\n\n\n3. applicatiion class loader - it will load the classes of our own application ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class loader system - it will load the classes\n \nwhich ever classes will be loaded so that its object will be created in HEAP area \n\n1. bootstrap loader - all the fundamental classes for java whichever are use for our program\n\nYour Program\n     ↓\nneeds String\n     ↓\nBootstrap Class Loader\n     ↓\nloads fundamental Java classes\n\n\n2. extenison class loader -those classes which help in runtime enviroment will be loaded by\nexteinion class loader.\n\n\n\n3. applicatiion class loader - it will load the classes of our own application ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
