      "text": "linking - \n\n1. verify - itwll check whethere the byte code is perfect or not it mean this will check the if our program /code is secure or not\n\n2.prepare - it will allocate memory for stattic variable \n\n3. resolve - it helps in linking\n\n\ninitilisation - This will initilise static variable . it means itwll also execute static blocks . ",
