      "seed": 1131887591,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 1329119945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787677288454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. METHOD AREA - ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. METHOD AREA - ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bcApaZzQOe2wDT2k7iI2c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3049.385413537045,
      "y": 680.8625966418483,
      "width": 410.28289794921875,
      "height": 451.20666541137433,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 809994601,
      "version": 796,
      "versionNonce": 1373658985,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787677108677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class Student {\n    String name = \"Anurag\";\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n\n    static int count = 0;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int x = 10;\n\n        Student s = new Student();\n\n        count++;\n\n        System.out.println(s.name);\n    }\n}",
      "fontSize": 20.053629573838858,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class Student {\n    String name = \"Anurag\";\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n\n    static int count = 0;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int x = 10;\n\n        Student s = new Student();\n\n        count++;\n\n        System.out.println(s.name);\n    }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0dzuh-VzLrMWxKwq75iL0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3665.0923986789976,
      "y": 698.8054488874154,
      "width": 726.291748046875,
      "height": 249.15207766719487,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 153508999,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 1951047113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787677112030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Class information       → Method Area\nstatic count            → Method Area\nx                       → Stack\nStudent object          → Heap\ns reference             → Stack\nname                    → Heap (inside Student object)\ncurrent instruction     → PC Register",
      "fontSize": 28.47452316196513,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Class information       → Method Area\nstatic count            → Method Area\nx                       → Stack\nStudent object          → Heap\ns reference             → Stack\nname                    → Heap (inside Student object)\ncurrent instruction     → PC Register",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DV0PAuoXNI7pyY2vHp73a",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2960.411313096946,
      "y": 647.7963520232565,
      "width": 1550.109396567425,
      "height": 523.787750996677,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b00",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1844230023,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 166274729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787677117592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "KSiMdy3NHmnHqBkSXF4kp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2001.240917173252,
      "y": 1096.7463102316112,
      "width": 550.0396118164062,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 331371497,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 45583241,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787677290579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Method Area stores information related to classes.\n\nWhen the Class Loader loads:\n\nMain.class\nStudent.class\n\nthe JVM needs to remember information such as:\n\nClass name\nMethod information\nMethod bytecode\nStatic variables",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Method Area stores information related to classes.\n\nWhen the Class Loader loads:\n\nMain.class\nStudent.class\n\nthe JVM needs to remember information such as:\n\nClass name\nMethod information\nMethod bytecode\nStatic variables",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VTHZbL3omAbB-dQgs8uF6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1986.8670962354793,
      "y": 1459.8045674456569,
      "width": 828.4046630859375,
      "height": 358.8019644366342,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 813839849,
      "version": 285,
      "versionNonce": 718315123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787678148162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.HEAP AREA\n  The Heap Area is a part of JVM memory mainly used to store objects and arrays.\nStudent s = new Student();\n\nStudent s        =        new  Student()\n     \n\n\n                        Create object\n     │                         \n\n Reference               HEAP\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20.502969396379097,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.HEAP AREA\n  The Heap Area is a part of JVM memory mainly used to store objects and arrays.\nStudent s = new Student();\n\nStudent s        =        new  Student()\n     \n\n\n                        Create object\n     │                         \n\n Reference               HEAP\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Dz5YmD7ZRrFaI-9QkpUmQ",
